sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Nginx as nginx mTLS Sidecar<br/>(optional)<br/>TLS 1.2
    participant REST as OVMS REST Server<br/>configurable port
    participant GRPC as OVMS gRPC Server<br/>configurable port
    participant Router as Request Router
    participant ModelMgr as Model Manager
    participant OVRT as OpenVINO Runtime
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>/mnt/models

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: REST Inference Request (TFS v1)
        Client->>REST: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict
        REST->>Router: Route by URI pattern
        Router->>ModelMgr: TFS v1 predict handler
        ModelMgr->>OVRT: Execute inference
        OVRT-->>ModelMgr: Prediction result
        ModelMgr-->>REST: JSON response
        REST-->>Client: 200 OK + prediction
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: REST Inference Request (KServe v2)
        Client->>REST: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer
        REST->>Router: Route by URI pattern
        Router->>ModelMgr: KFS v2 infer handler
        ModelMgr->>OVRT: Execute inference
        OVRT-->>ModelMgr: Prediction result
        ModelMgr-->>REST: JSON response
        REST-->>Client: 200 OK + inference result
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 3: OpenAI-compatible v3 (generative)
        Client->>REST: POST /v3/v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer API key (optional)
        REST->>Router: Route by URI pattern
        Router->>ModelMgr: OpenAI v3 handler
        ModelMgr->>OVRT: Execute generation (vLLM)
        OVRT-->>ModelMgr: Generated response
        ModelMgr-->>REST: JSON response
        REST-->>Client: 200 OK + completion
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 4: gRPC Inference Request
        Client->>GRPC: PredictionService.Predict()
        GRPC->>ModelMgr: TFS PredictionService dispatch
        ModelMgr->>OVRT: Execute inference
        OVRT-->>ModelMgr: Prediction result
        ModelMgr-->>GRPC: PredictResponse
        GRPC-->>Client: gRPC response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 5: mTLS Sidecar Pattern (optional)
        Client->>Nginx: HTTPS + client certificate<br/>TLS 1.2 AES256+EECDH
        Nginx->>Nginx: Verify client cert<br/>(ssl_verify_client on)
        Nginx->>REST: proxy_pass to localhost
        REST->>ModelMgr: Process request
        ModelMgr-->>REST: Response
        REST-->>Nginx: Response
        Nginx-->>Client: TLS-encrypted response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 6: Model Loading
        Storage->>ModelMgr: Model artifacts from<br/>--model_path or --config_path
        ModelMgr->>OVRT: Load model into runtime
        Note over ModelMgr: Polls at<br/>--file_system_poll_wait_seconds
    end
